WEBVTT

01:33.370 --> 01:35.641
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.701 --> 01:38.001
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.070 --> 01:40.971
(Episode 17)

01:41.111 --> 01:42.710
(Charge up)

01:49.620 --> 01:51.421
Today, we have joint training...

01:51.490 --> 01:53.051
between firefighters and medical staff.

01:53.790 --> 01:55.520
Our goal is for the firefighters...

01:55.790 --> 01:57.191
to quickly transport the medical staff...

01:57.260 --> 01:58.831
to the area near the injured...

01:58.891 --> 02:00.361
during the rescue.

02:00.490 --> 02:01.561
When the medical staff are transporting...

02:01.630 --> 02:02.430
the injured,

02:02.730 --> 02:04.031
they also have to coordinate with the firefighters.

02:04.361 --> 02:05.630
Whether the joint rescue team...

02:05.730 --> 02:07.430
can operate smoothly or not...

02:07.630 --> 02:08.370
depends...

02:08.671 --> 02:09.471
on the cooperation...

02:09.941 --> 02:10.740
and trust...

02:10.801 --> 02:12.210
between the medical staff and firefighters.

02:12.671 --> 02:13.841
Today, you'll be divided into two teams.

02:14.411 --> 02:15.740
The training we're going to do...

02:16.341 --> 02:17.510
is rappeling...

02:17.911 --> 02:20.050
and 15m ladder climbing.

02:20.580 --> 02:22.021
Let me divide you into teams.

02:24.251 --> 02:24.950
Zhan Da Peng.

02:25.350 --> 02:26.021
Present.

02:26.091 --> 02:26.751
Team up with Li Nan.

02:27.050 --> 02:27.751
Yes.

02:28.721 --> 02:29.390
Yang Chi.

02:29.461 --> 02:30.121
Present.

02:30.420 --> 02:31.320
Team up with Xu Xi.

02:31.390 --> 02:32.061
Yes.

02:32.531 --> 02:33.191
Liu Jun Ping.

02:33.260 --> 02:34.091
Yes.

02:34.461 --> 02:35.501
Team up with Feng Bei.

02:35.561 --> 02:36.230
Yes.

02:36.700 --> 02:37.360
Gao Yun.

02:37.431 --> 02:38.100
Yes.

02:38.830 --> 02:39.931
Team up with Chen Dong Dong.

02:40.001 --> 02:40.700
Yes.

02:44.771 --> 02:45.471
Xu Qin.

02:47.070 --> 02:48.341
Team up with Song Yan.

02:48.411 --> 02:49.540
- Jiang Yi. - Yes.

02:49.811 --> 02:51.040
Team up with Dr. Xu.

02:56.021 --> 02:56.850
Chief.

02:57.221 --> 02:58.080
That's inappropriate.

02:59.151 --> 02:59.950
Go.

03:01.621 --> 03:02.290
Yes!

03:02.691 --> 03:03.591
I'll get the job done.

03:06.061 --> 03:07.661
Why did you push me, Yang Chi?

03:08.661 --> 03:09.401
Chief.

03:09.461 --> 03:10.260
I sprained my ankle.

03:11.230 --> 03:11.901
Get serious.

03:12.730 --> 03:13.401
Chief.

03:14.070 --> 03:14.941
I sprained my ankle.

03:16.100 --> 03:17.300
Why don't you go?

03:19.070 --> 03:20.341
Why don't I treat it for you?

03:24.110 --> 03:25.411
I'm fine now.

03:27.510 --> 03:28.181
Chief.

03:28.251 --> 03:28.950
I'll get the job done.

03:29.521 --> 03:30.181
All right.

03:30.850 --> 03:31.691
Let's start the training!

03:31.890 --> 03:32.991
- Yes, sir! - Yes, sir!

03:33.050 --> 03:34.550
(Charge up)

03:34.621 --> 03:36.091
Dr. Xu, here.

03:38.390 --> 03:39.061
Okay.

03:39.991 --> 03:41.290
Don't worry. It's very safe.

03:41.501 --> 03:42.230
As long as the checkup is done,

03:42.300 --> 03:42.961
there won't be any problem.

03:43.300 --> 03:43.961
Okay.

03:49.300 --> 03:50.501
You call yourself an instructor?

03:50.570 --> 03:51.771
Why are you taking the lead in kicking up a fuss?

03:53.941 --> 03:54.841
Bringing lovers together...

03:55.110 --> 03:56.610
is also within my scope.

03:58.510 --> 03:59.350
Go away.

04:15.001 --> 04:15.661
Not bad.

04:16.630 --> 04:17.561
I can see it.

04:22.941 --> 04:23.600
Li Nan.

04:23.670 --> 04:24.401
Li Nan?

04:24.911 --> 04:26.670
Do you know how many years I'm older than you?

04:27.011 --> 04:28.240
Call me Ms. Nan.

04:29.141 --> 04:30.281
I'm the teacher here.

04:30.341 --> 04:32.180
Of course, I can call you Li Nan.

04:32.750 --> 04:33.711
When you go down,

04:33.781 --> 04:34.810
your feet must...

04:50.031 --> 04:51.831
The best way to overcome fear...

04:52.300 --> 04:53.430
is to face it.

04:53.571 --> 04:54.670
I can't face it.

05:03.810 --> 05:04.711
Open your eyes.

05:05.951 --> 05:07.250
It's okay. Crawl bravely.

05:15.891 --> 05:16.560
What's wrong?

05:16.620 --> 05:17.420
It's okay.

05:25.271 --> 05:26.131
Why are you crying?

05:26.471 --> 05:27.300
Don't cry.

05:27.571 --> 05:28.670
Were you scared?

05:31.271 --> 05:31.940
Well...

05:32.011 --> 05:33.370
I didn't yell at you just now, did I?

05:33.571 --> 05:34.540
I'm a boor.

05:34.610 --> 05:35.610
I didn't consider your feelings.

05:35.781 --> 05:36.841
It's okay.

05:37.540 --> 05:38.211
I...

05:38.281 --> 05:39.781
I really...

05:39.980 --> 05:42.050
I really cry easily.

05:43.151 --> 05:44.081
I'm sorry.

05:59.071 --> 05:59.730
Look.

05:59.800 --> 06:00.670
I'm fine now, right?

06:05.540 --> 06:07.071
This girl is really weird.

06:08.341 --> 06:09.180
She's quite cute.

06:09.940 --> 06:10.740
What are you looking at?

06:10.810 --> 06:11.610
Prepare the rappel.

07:00.891 --> 07:01.661
Dr. Xu.

07:02.560 --> 07:03.730
I want to ask you a question.

07:04.661 --> 07:05.331
Go ahead.

07:05.870 --> 07:06.730
After a meal,

07:06.901 --> 07:08.571
isn't it inappropriate to do strenuous exercises?

07:10.471 --> 07:11.401
It depends on one's mood.

07:13.940 --> 07:15.180
Can a doctor be so willful?

07:17.411 --> 07:18.550
Why did you intentionally avoid me...

07:19.211 --> 07:20.581
at the training ground today?

07:21.610 --> 07:22.821
Did I do something...

07:22.881 --> 07:24.081
to make you feel uncomfortable?

07:26.750 --> 07:27.821
I didn't pair up with you...

07:28.661 --> 07:30.221
because I'm afraid they'll get distracted...

07:30.661 --> 07:31.730
if they're too busy watching us.

07:32.930 --> 07:33.591
Got it.

07:34.891 --> 07:35.761
From now on,

07:36.161 --> 07:37.761
I'll keep a distance from you.

07:55.821 --> 07:56.951
Why did you turn off my machine?

07:58.750 --> 08:00.290
Aren't you out of breath from chatting while running?

08:07.190 --> 08:08.461
It's not training time now.

08:09.230 --> 08:10.100
You're not the instructor.

08:10.300 --> 08:11.131
And I'm not a trainee.

08:11.901 --> 08:13.071
It's my time. I call the shots.

08:15.141 --> 08:15.800
I admit defeat.

08:16.901 --> 08:17.701
You're awesome.

08:18.100 --> 08:18.971
All right?

08:20.411 --> 08:21.781
It's not the first day we've met.

08:22.011 --> 08:23.310
I've been awesome for a long time.

08:27.581 --> 08:28.350
What's wrong?

08:30.081 --> 08:31.180
I got a cramp.

08:31.680 --> 08:32.350
Come on.

08:35.790 --> 08:36.521
Thigh or calf?

08:36.821 --> 08:37.591
Calf.

08:40.330 --> 08:40.991
What are you doing?

08:42.161 --> 08:43.031
What do you think?

08:43.700 --> 08:45.470
I'm used to rescuing victims with smelly feet.

08:45.970 --> 08:46.930
You're the one with smelly feet.

08:48.070 --> 08:49.940
It's because I've trained all day today.

08:51.170 --> 08:52.011
Gentler.

08:54.070 --> 08:54.741
Endure it a bit.

09:01.310 --> 09:02.180
Gentler.

09:09.121 --> 09:10.190
It hurts so much.

09:29.981 --> 09:31.111
Gentler.

09:36.180 --> 09:36.981
Chief.

09:37.151 --> 09:38.251
Do you need help?

09:49.761 --> 09:50.460
Let's train.

10:04.381 --> 10:05.080
Are you feeling better?

10:06.710 --> 10:07.481
Yes.

10:12.151 --> 10:12.851
You guys.

10:13.190 --> 10:14.220
Bring Dr. Xu back.

10:14.450 --> 10:15.391
- Yes. - Yes.

10:16.861 --> 10:18.590
Dr. Xu, are you okay?

10:19.060 --> 10:19.930
We'll bring you back.

10:20.060 --> 10:20.960
Why don't you hold onto us?

10:21.031 --> 10:21.690
That's right.

10:22.560 --> 10:23.231
It's okay.

10:24.131 --> 10:24.861
I can manage.

10:25.300 --> 10:26.031
Thank you.

10:37.141 --> 10:39.450
(Wu Ming Oil Painting Exhibition, Marionettes)

10:46.290 --> 10:48.050
This painting has a blue theme.

10:48.251 --> 10:49.590
There are many more in the same series.

10:49.690 --> 10:50.391
If you're interested,

10:50.460 --> 10:51.690
you can take a look.

10:52.991 --> 10:53.830
Take your time.

11:01.470 --> 11:02.141
Mr. Meng.

11:06.470 --> 11:07.611
How are you doing...

11:07.940 --> 11:08.611
in working part-time here?

11:08.981 --> 11:09.810
It's quite good.

11:10.340 --> 11:11.340
I even get a commission...

11:11.411 --> 11:12.511
for selling paintings.

11:12.911 --> 11:13.651
That's good.

11:19.950 --> 11:21.420
This is a solo exhibition...

11:21.491 --> 11:22.861
from a rising artist, Wu Ming.

11:22.920 --> 11:24.460
The theme is marionettes.

11:25.021 --> 11:26.930
This painting is called "Popping Dance".

11:27.631 --> 11:28.361
This painting is...

11:28.430 --> 11:29.700
Are you trying to sell it to me?

11:34.601 --> 11:35.871
I don't really like this painting.

11:40.710 --> 11:41.840
I feel like...

11:42.340 --> 11:43.781
it's a bit creepy.

11:47.781 --> 11:48.680
You think so too?

11:50.151 --> 11:51.220
It's just a feeling.

11:51.281 --> 11:52.420
I don't know much about paintings.

11:52.851 --> 11:53.720
I just think that this painting...

11:53.790 --> 11:55.190
looks a bit depressing.

11:55.690 --> 11:56.720
It's quite ironic.

12:00.060 --> 12:00.731
Mr. Meng.

12:02.031 --> 12:03.261
It's really you, Mr. Meng.

12:03.460 --> 12:04.661
Hello.

12:04.731 --> 12:06.231
What brings you here?

12:06.470 --> 12:07.271
It's such an honor...

12:07.330 --> 12:08.771
to have you in our small exhibit hall.

12:09.101 --> 12:09.901
You're too kind.

12:10.570 --> 12:11.470
Are you here alone?

12:11.570 --> 12:12.670
Is your father not here?

12:12.810 --> 12:13.570
He's very busy.

12:13.771 --> 12:15.540
Unlike me, I have nothing to do.

12:16.111 --> 12:17.440
Mr. Meng, don't say that.

12:17.511 --> 12:18.381
You're too modest.

12:18.440 --> 12:19.351
Who doesn't know that your family...

12:19.411 --> 12:20.550
is an expert...

12:20.611 --> 12:23.021
in artwork investment?

12:24.050 --> 12:24.920
Are you free later?

12:24.981 --> 12:25.950
Let me treat you to a meal...

12:26.021 --> 12:26.851
and learn...

12:27.021 --> 12:27.891
a thing or two from you.

12:29.861 --> 12:30.521
I'm sorry.

12:31.090 --> 12:31.861
It's not a good time.

12:33.190 --> 12:33.930
It's okay.

12:34.361 --> 12:35.031
How about this?

12:35.090 --> 12:36.430
I'll show you around.

12:36.531 --> 12:37.330
I don't want to trouble you.

12:38.131 --> 12:39.631
She can keep me company.

12:42.340 --> 12:43.501
That's all right too.

12:43.800 --> 12:44.470
Ye Zi.

12:44.540 --> 12:46.741
Make sure you entertain Mr. Meng well.

12:47.570 --> 12:48.271
Mr. Meng.

12:48.371 --> 12:49.040
Feel free to look around.

12:49.580 --> 12:50.241
All right.

12:56.781 --> 12:58.521
I'll show you the other paintings then.

12:58.580 --> 12:59.420
Don't mind me.

13:00.690 --> 13:01.521
Get back to work.

13:05.121 --> 13:05.790
Okay.

13:16.840 --> 13:19.771
(Wu Ming Oil Painting Exhibition, Marionettes)

13:24.210 --> 13:24.881
Ms. Wu.

13:24.940 --> 13:26.481
I'm off work. I'm going home.

13:26.550 --> 13:27.310
Ye Zi.

13:27.550 --> 13:28.981
No, don't go yet.

13:29.050 --> 13:30.251
Come, sit down.

13:30.420 --> 13:31.420
I need to talk to you.

13:31.781 --> 13:32.590
Here, sit down.

13:36.090 --> 13:36.891
Here's the thing, Ye Zi.

13:37.391 --> 13:38.690
Are you close...

13:38.891 --> 13:39.991
with Mr. Meng?

13:41.231 --> 13:41.960
No.

13:42.960 --> 13:43.761
No?

13:44.501 --> 13:46.300
Then why did HR tell me...

13:46.371 --> 13:47.970
that the person who recommended you to work here...

13:48.031 --> 13:49.200
is his assistant?

13:49.540 --> 13:50.340
Maybe...

13:50.501 --> 13:52.611
I used to work at his friend's bar.

13:52.670 --> 13:53.641
He thought I looked familiar,

13:53.710 --> 13:55.371
so he just helped out.

13:56.641 --> 13:57.511
I see.

13:59.411 --> 14:01.651
Then you should thank him.

14:02.251 --> 14:02.950
How about this?

14:03.351 --> 14:04.481
Treat him to a meal...

14:04.680 --> 14:05.820
to show your gratitude.

14:06.220 --> 14:08.021
Of course, I'll pay for the meal.

14:08.220 --> 14:08.920
What do you think?

14:10.060 --> 14:10.790
Mr. Wu.

14:11.060 --> 14:12.731
I really don't know Mr. Meng well.

14:12.861 --> 14:14.590
I don't even have his contact information.

14:14.661 --> 14:16.330
How can I treat him to a meal?

14:19.131 --> 14:20.470
If there's nothing else,

14:20.531 --> 14:22.001
I'm going back to school.

14:22.300 --> 14:23.141
Don't.

14:23.540 --> 14:24.470
Have you eaten?

14:25.001 --> 14:25.670
I...

14:25.970 --> 14:27.170
I'll eat at the campus.

14:27.741 --> 14:28.540
Don't.

14:28.810 --> 14:30.180
I haven't eaten either.

14:30.340 --> 14:31.040
How about this?

14:31.111 --> 14:31.981
Let's have a quick meal together.

14:32.251 --> 14:33.550
I'll take you back to school afterward.

14:34.151 --> 14:35.111
It's okay, Mr. Wu.

14:35.180 --> 14:36.351
I have something to do at school.

14:36.580 --> 14:37.881
I really have to go.

14:39.590 --> 14:40.621
All right then.

14:42.021 --> 14:43.190
Be careful.

15:04.241 --> 15:04.940
Xiao Meng.

15:05.950 --> 15:06.611
What's up?

15:07.911 --> 15:08.580
Come here.

15:10.950 --> 15:12.220
Are you calling him?

15:12.651 --> 15:13.991
He's Xiao Meng?

15:14.090 --> 15:15.050
Which Meng character?

15:17.820 --> 15:18.661
Little Plate Meng.

15:19.131 --> 15:19.830
You...

15:23.131 --> 15:23.901
Which Meng character?

15:23.960 --> 15:24.661
Which Qin character?

15:25.670 --> 15:26.501
"Meng" of son and plate characters.

15:26.570 --> 15:27.570
"Qin" of water and heart characters.

15:28.731 --> 15:29.871
What a good girl.

15:46.090 --> 15:47.220
Xiao Meng.

15:50.121 --> 15:51.661
That's such a nice name.

15:54.790 --> 15:55.861
It must be hard on you...

15:56.430 --> 15:58.861
to be around someone with such a bad temper.

16:00.170 --> 16:01.271
Thank you for your hard work.

16:02.601 --> 16:03.800
He likes me a lot.

16:06.611 --> 16:07.310
Of course.

16:07.771 --> 16:08.710
You're family.

16:09.810 --> 16:10.540
Let's go, Xiao Meng.

16:12.180 --> 16:13.310
What do you mean?

16:14.111 --> 16:15.351
Are you calling me a dog?

16:15.781 --> 16:17.351
Come on, Xiao Meng. Run.

16:18.851 --> 16:19.590
Run!

16:22.491 --> 16:24.021
Who are you calling a dog?

16:25.731 --> 16:26.830
Run!

17:20.051 --> 17:21.551
Two emergency rescue vehicles.

17:21.611 --> 17:22.551
One ambulance.

17:22.821 --> 17:24.081
Joint rescue team, get in position.

17:24.151 --> 17:24.950
Prepare for rescue.

17:31.520 --> 17:32.430
Get up!

17:33.791 --> 17:34.831
Dispatch?

17:47.811 --> 17:49.440
(Yanbei Firefighting Promotional Vehicle)

18:22.811 --> 18:23.841
Take the child.

18:25.980 --> 18:27.551
Mom!

18:48.301 --> 18:50.000
Mom!

18:50.700 --> 18:51.740
Help!

18:51.801 --> 18:53.541
Mom.

18:54.611 --> 18:55.470
Help!

18:55.541 --> 18:57.811
My leg is stuck!

19:02.950 --> 19:04.151
Chen Yu!

19:27.510 --> 19:28.940
A vehicle. An ambulance.

19:37.881 --> 19:38.920
- The scene is this way. - What's the situation?

19:38.980 --> 19:40.450
The bus flipped over from here.

19:40.750 --> 19:41.791
There are still passengers trapped inside.

19:42.291 --> 19:43.260
The casualties are unknown.

19:45.061 --> 19:45.861
Let's split up and check.

19:46.861 --> 19:47.760
Sir.

19:48.131 --> 19:49.460
You have to save my friend.

19:49.831 --> 19:51.200
He fell with the bus.

19:51.260 --> 19:52.061
He's wearing a gray shirt...

19:52.131 --> 19:53.470
and a black baseball cap.

19:53.631 --> 19:54.831
I'm begging you. Please save him.

19:54.901 --> 19:56.740
Sir, you have to save him.

19:56.970 --> 19:58.200
He saved all of us.

19:58.270 --> 19:59.071
He's a hero.

19:59.141 --> 20:00.510
He's the one who saved us.

20:03.210 --> 20:03.980
Dr. Xu!

20:04.041 --> 20:04.710
Present!

20:04.780 --> 20:06.651
Move the injured to a safe place.

20:06.710 --> 20:08.210
Without my permission, don't come near here!

20:08.581 --> 20:09.280
Yes.

20:09.351 --> 20:10.480
Help each other out.

20:10.621 --> 20:11.780
Follow us to the ambulance.

20:12.151 --> 20:12.821
Come on.

20:12.950 --> 20:13.750
Slowly.

20:14.151 --> 20:15.420
Hang in there.

20:15.490 --> 20:16.190
Be careful.

20:16.260 --> 20:16.920
Hold onto me.

20:18.391 --> 20:19.591
Ma'am, go over there first.

20:19.661 --> 20:20.331
Rest assured. Don't be anxious.

20:20.391 --> 20:21.131
We'll surely save him.

20:21.430 --> 20:22.260
Don't worry.

20:22.631 --> 20:23.361
Yang Chi.

20:23.430 --> 20:24.901
Take a team and rappel down for search and rescue.

20:24.960 --> 20:25.871
- Okay. - Bring visual equipment.

20:25.930 --> 20:26.601
Yes, sir.

20:26.831 --> 20:27.601
- Jiang Yi. - Present.

20:27.670 --> 20:28.430
- Pi Pi. - Present.

20:28.500 --> 20:29.240
- Da Peng. - Present.

20:29.301 --> 20:30.240
- Gao Yu. - Present.

20:30.301 --> 20:30.970
Prepare for search and rescue.

20:31.041 --> 20:31.770
- Yes! - Yes!

20:37.510 --> 20:38.180
Chief.

20:38.240 --> 20:38.980
Equipment check complete.

20:39.180 --> 20:39.851
Go.

20:39.911 --> 20:40.611
- Yes! - Yes!

21:27.930 --> 21:28.831
Lift it higher.

21:28.891 --> 21:29.661
My head.

21:45.341 --> 21:46.851
Come on, kid.

21:46.911 --> 21:47.911
Let me take a look.

21:48.111 --> 21:49.520
Mom, it hurts.

21:49.581 --> 21:50.280
Dr. Xu.

21:50.621 --> 21:52.081
A critical patient is in shock.

21:52.151 --> 21:52.821
Hurry.

21:53.950 --> 21:54.651
Li Nan.

21:55.091 --> 21:55.791
Li Nan!

21:56.220 --> 21:56.891
Coming.

21:58.891 --> 21:59.990
There are more casualties now.

22:00.061 --> 22:00.990
We're in charge of triage.

22:01.490 --> 22:02.530
Depending on the severity of the injury,

22:02.601 --> 22:03.760
- put wristbands on them. - Okay.

22:03.831 --> 22:05.101
To know the order of treatment.

22:05.230 --> 22:06.000
On my way here,

22:06.071 --> 22:07.270
I contacted the Emergency Center.

22:07.470 --> 22:08.470
Once the ambulance arrives,

22:09.101 --> 22:10.740
we can prioritize transporting the seriously injured.

22:10.871 --> 22:11.940
Hurry. Be quick.

22:13.811 --> 22:14.770
Where is she hurt?

22:14.940 --> 22:15.611
Her eye.

22:16.411 --> 22:17.411
Just her head?

22:37.460 --> 22:38.131
Yang Chi!

22:42.401 --> 22:44.000
Yang Chi, I got you.

22:45.541 --> 22:46.311
Yang Chi.

22:48.141 --> 22:49.240
I got you. It's okay.

22:49.611 --> 22:50.311
Come on. Let's go.

22:50.381 --> 22:51.710
One, two. Let's go.

22:53.250 --> 22:54.381
One, two.

22:54.611 --> 22:55.280
Come on.

23:11.061 --> 23:13.170
Mom, it hurts!

23:13.930 --> 23:15.970
I'll come and check on you later. Hang in there.

23:16.270 --> 23:17.770
Baby, don't cry.

23:19.371 --> 23:20.541
I'll tie a yellow one for you.

23:20.611 --> 23:21.811
When the ambulance arrives,

23:22.210 --> 23:23.510
go with them, okay?

23:32.180 --> 23:33.250
Come and help. Hurry.

23:33.490 --> 23:34.520
Give us a hand.

23:34.591 --> 23:36.091
Come on. One, two, three, up.

23:36.321 --> 23:37.821
- Let's go. - Go.

23:42.661 --> 23:44.000
Everyone, be quiet first.

23:44.061 --> 23:44.960
Listen to me, okay?

23:45.030 --> 23:46.230
Let's do something first.

23:46.301 --> 23:48.131
Take the injured with red wristbands...

23:48.200 --> 23:49.801
to the ambulance.

23:50.371 --> 23:51.901
Those with yellow wristbands,

23:52.341 --> 23:53.440
get on the minibus.

23:53.510 --> 23:54.641
And parents.

23:54.710 --> 23:56.510
Take the kid on the minibus, okay?

23:56.641 --> 23:58.381
Those with blue wristbands,

23:58.440 --> 23:59.450
please wait for a while.

23:59.510 --> 24:00.651
Our vehicle is on its way.

24:00.710 --> 24:02.411
It will be here soon, okay?

24:20.571 --> 24:21.700
Da Peng, go over there.

24:21.770 --> 24:22.500
Okay.

24:34.651 --> 24:36.220
One, two, three, go.

24:36.920 --> 24:37.581
Come on.

24:41.220 --> 24:42.791
This won't do. Class Monitor, push him forward.

24:42.861 --> 24:43.520
Okay.

24:46.591 --> 24:47.331
Okay, go.

24:47.460 --> 24:48.260
How is it? Come on.

24:48.331 --> 24:49.291
Slowly.

24:50.730 --> 24:51.401
Out.

24:52.301 --> 24:52.970
Slowly.

24:55.131 --> 24:55.930
Speed up.

24:59.071 --> 25:00.911
Check carefully if there are any more casualties.

25:08.680 --> 25:09.381
Dr. Xu.

25:09.450 --> 25:10.551
There's another casualty here.

25:12.321 --> 25:12.990
Hurry.

25:20.061 --> 25:20.990
Get him in that ambulance.

25:21.061 --> 25:21.730
Take him to the hospital.

25:21.791 --> 25:22.960
- All right. Go. - Go.

25:23.430 --> 25:24.200
Okay.

25:24.500 --> 25:25.500
How many more are injured down there?

25:27.170 --> 25:27.831
Yang Chi.

25:27.901 --> 25:29.071
Is there anyone else trapped down there?

25:30.770 --> 25:31.670
There are no more casualties.

25:31.770 --> 25:33.341
The one that was just sent up is the last one.

25:33.510 --> 25:34.270
No.

25:34.371 --> 25:35.811
My friend is still down there.

25:35.940 --> 25:36.611
His name is Chen Yu.

25:36.680 --> 25:38.041
He has short hair, wearing a gray shirt...

25:38.111 --> 25:38.841
and a black baseball cap.

25:38.911 --> 25:39.851
Please find him.

25:39.911 --> 25:41.311
Don't panic first.

25:41.480 --> 25:42.151
Calm down.

25:42.210 --> 25:43.881
The people we rescued are all up here.

25:43.950 --> 25:44.920
Why don't you take a closer look?

25:44.980 --> 25:46.351
I've looked everywhere.

25:46.420 --> 25:47.791
I couldn't find him.

25:47.851 --> 25:48.990
He saved us.

25:49.051 --> 25:50.220
When the bus lost control,

25:50.291 --> 25:51.190
he broke the window,

25:51.260 --> 25:52.861
pushed us out, and saved us.

25:52.930 --> 25:53.930
He hasn't come up yet.

25:53.990 --> 25:55.030
You must find him.

25:55.091 --> 25:56.091
Don't get agitated first.

25:56.161 --> 25:57.101
Calm down first.

25:58.161 --> 25:58.960
Yang Chi.

25:59.030 --> 26:00.500
Are you sure there's no one trapped down there?

26:00.571 --> 26:02.200
They said there was a man in a gray shirt.

26:02.270 --> 26:03.200
We didn't find him.

26:04.541 --> 26:05.200
Yang Chi.

26:05.871 --> 26:06.871
Expand the search area.

26:07.571 --> 26:08.240
Copy that.

26:08.311 --> 26:08.970
Jiang Yi.

26:09.041 --> 26:10.381
Wait, there's one more. Keep looking.

26:10.510 --> 26:11.341
Pi Pi, Da Peng, Gao Yu.

26:11.780 --> 26:12.440
Keep looking.

26:12.510 --> 26:13.180
Yes.

26:18.180 --> 26:18.980
He saved us.

26:19.051 --> 26:20.151
You must find him.

26:20.220 --> 26:21.091
We wouldn't have gotten out without him.

26:21.151 --> 26:22.420
Don't be anxious first.

26:22.490 --> 26:23.220
Yang Chi.

26:23.520 --> 26:24.520
Can you look again?

26:25.420 --> 26:26.391
He might have fallen off the bus...

26:26.591 --> 26:27.490
when it fell off the cliff.

26:41.571 --> 26:42.341
Let me see.

26:49.411 --> 26:51.051
Could he have fallen off the cliff?

26:51.250 --> 26:52.351
His chances aren't good.

26:56.821 --> 26:57.490
Chief.

26:57.690 --> 26:58.891
We can't see clearly down the cliff.

27:01.391 --> 27:02.960
Check the area first and be careful.

27:03.561 --> 27:04.930
Yes. Search carefully again.

27:05.230 --> 27:05.901
Yes.

27:12.500 --> 27:13.811
Yang Chi.

27:13.940 --> 27:14.940
Over here!

27:15.311 --> 27:15.970
We found him.

27:16.911 --> 27:17.581
They found him.

27:18.541 --> 27:19.210
Let's go.

27:25.450 --> 27:26.450
Over here.

27:31.190 --> 27:32.220
That's him!

27:32.690 --> 27:33.361
This is great.

27:33.430 --> 27:34.490
Save him.

27:43.700 --> 27:44.470
Come on.

27:48.541 --> 27:49.680
Put him down first.

27:49.740 --> 27:50.841
Place him on the mat.

27:51.041 --> 27:51.980
Slowly.

27:57.381 --> 27:58.051
Chief.

27:58.121 --> 27:59.220
The patient's condition is very complicated.

27:59.381 --> 28:00.291
We don't dare to treat him.

28:00.351 --> 28:01.051
We need a doctor.

28:01.791 --> 28:02.621
I'll go down.

28:03.621 --> 28:04.291
Chief.

28:04.460 --> 28:05.420
The situation is very dangerous now.

28:05.490 --> 28:07.260
The bus can flip over and fall again at any time.

28:07.530 --> 28:08.760
He can die at any time.

28:12.030 --> 28:12.760
Gear up.

28:13.730 --> 28:14.401
Got it.

28:14.470 --> 28:15.470
Dr. Xu. Come with me.

28:15.530 --> 28:16.200
Okay.

28:29.750 --> 28:30.680
I'll go down with you,

28:31.450 --> 28:32.220
Dr. Xu.

28:42.161 --> 28:42.831
Dr. Xu.

28:43.500 --> 28:44.230
Be careful.

28:44.401 --> 28:45.061
Okay.

29:31.940 --> 29:32.611
Dr. Xu.

29:59.101 --> 29:59.770
Da Peng.

30:08.811 --> 30:09.510
Chen Yu.

30:10.151 --> 30:10.851
Chen Yu.

30:11.551 --> 30:13.051
Chen Yu, can you hear me?

30:13.621 --> 30:14.291
Chen Yu.

30:29.131 --> 30:29.871
Chen Yu.

30:31.071 --> 30:32.500
Chen Yu, wake up.

30:34.371 --> 30:35.071
Chen Yu.

30:39.041 --> 30:40.010
Chen Yu, are you awake?

30:43.750 --> 30:44.420
Chen Yu.

30:45.680 --> 30:46.651
Where does it hurt?

30:49.091 --> 30:49.920
My stomach.

30:50.220 --> 30:51.690
Your stomach. Anywhere else?

30:51.891 --> 30:52.990
My arm.

30:54.030 --> 30:55.230
It hurts everywhere.

30:55.530 --> 30:57.061
Stay awake, okay?

30:57.230 --> 30:58.131
Don't fall asleep.

30:58.260 --> 30:59.970
A lot of people are waiting for you up there.

31:00.500 --> 31:01.470
They're waiting for me?

31:01.970 --> 31:03.141
You're a hero.

31:03.200 --> 31:04.470
You saved everyone.

31:06.170 --> 31:06.871
Chen Yu.

31:07.210 --> 31:08.611
Chen Yu, stay awake.

31:08.770 --> 31:09.641
Keep talking to me.

31:09.911 --> 31:10.811
What did you do?

31:13.551 --> 31:14.651
I also don't know...

31:16.111 --> 31:18.020
why I did that.

31:38.470 --> 31:39.500
At first,

31:40.940 --> 31:43.940
I just wanted to bring all the kids out,

31:45.541 --> 31:46.510
then...

31:46.710 --> 31:50.851
bring their moms out too.

31:54.750 --> 31:55.621
Go on.

31:55.851 --> 31:56.690
What happened next?

31:57.821 --> 31:58.720
Then...

32:00.460 --> 32:01.391
Stretcher.

32:01.730 --> 32:02.591
Stretcher.

32:03.700 --> 32:04.361
What happened next?

32:05.861 --> 32:06.730
Then...

32:07.730 --> 32:09.970
Help!

32:12.200 --> 32:15.170
I saw how grateful they were,

32:16.940 --> 32:17.911
so I...

32:19.641 --> 32:21.351
saved another one.

32:23.450 --> 32:25.180
And I saved another one.

32:31.061 --> 32:31.720
Hold onto me.

32:50.911 --> 32:51.581
Chen Yu.

32:51.641 --> 32:53.111
Chen Yu, don't fall asleep.

32:53.381 --> 32:54.351
Wake up, Chen Yu.

32:55.440 --> 32:56.250
Chen Yu.

32:57.225 --> 32:58.395
They're all alive...

32:58.558 --> 32:59.927
and waiting to thank you.

33:25.877 --> 33:26.947
Be careful. Retract the rope.

33:27.018 --> 33:27.687
Okay.

33:33.887 --> 33:34.957
Dr. Xu, you're so brave.

33:35.588 --> 33:37.127
With Chief Song here, I have nothing to fear.

33:37.498 --> 33:38.157
Chief.

33:38.927 --> 33:39.758
Give me a bottle of water too.

34:02.748 --> 34:03.417
Chief.

34:04.387 --> 34:05.117
Chief.

34:06.018 --> 34:07.258
Let's take a group photo.

34:07.328 --> 34:08.427
I want to send it to my mom.

34:09.957 --> 34:11.258
Please.

34:11.828 --> 34:13.427
Dr. Xu, take a picture of us.

34:13.667 --> 34:14.328
Come on.

34:16.297 --> 34:17.567
Chief, over here.

34:17.668 --> 34:18.598
- Have a seat. - Come on, Chief.

34:18.668 --> 34:19.768
Let's wrap up afterward.

34:20.208 --> 34:20.867
Dr. Xu.

34:20.938 --> 34:21.938
Make us look good.

34:22.007 --> 34:23.137
I want to send it to my mom.

34:23.337 --> 34:24.507
I'll send it to my girlfriend too.

34:25.108 --> 34:26.337
Are you ready?

34:26.438 --> 34:28.078
One, two, three.

34:32.717 --> 34:33.748
Another pose.

34:34.148 --> 34:35.317
One more time.

34:35.418 --> 34:37.018
- One more time. - Cheese.

34:37.887 --> 34:39.518
One, two, three.

34:39.717 --> 34:41.657
- Cheese. - Cheese.

36:20.157 --> 36:22.358
One, two, three.

36:57.858 --> 36:58.628
What's going on?

36:58.697 --> 36:59.358
Dr. Yang.

36:59.427 --> 37:00.527
The patient has multiple fractures in the lower extremities.

37:00.797 --> 37:02.098
Okay, get an orthopedic consultation.

37:04.367 --> 37:05.098
Slowly.

37:06.668 --> 37:07.668
Be careful. Help your family member.

37:08.507 --> 37:09.168
- Okay. - Go inside.

37:09.237 --> 37:10.038
Be careful.

37:10.108 --> 37:10.907
My head.

37:11.677 --> 37:12.438
My head.

37:13.608 --> 37:14.407
Send him to the debridement room.

37:16.447 --> 37:17.277
Is the kid okay?

37:18.317 --> 37:18.978
Dress his wound.

37:19.177 --> 37:19.978
Help her out.

37:20.987 --> 37:21.748
Dr. Yang.

37:21.918 --> 37:22.648
You don't say.

37:22.717 --> 37:23.958
This wristband is quite useful.

37:24.018 --> 37:26.117
- Whose idea is this? - Isn't it obvious?

37:26.188 --> 37:27.688
It must be the beautiful and kindhearted Dr. Xu.

37:27.887 --> 37:28.558
Be careful.

37:28.788 --> 37:30.257
We're now...

37:30.328 --> 37:31.898
in the emergency hall...

37:31.958 --> 37:33.157
of Municipal People's Hospital.

37:33.328 --> 37:34.367
The civilian hero...

37:34.427 --> 37:35.768
in this incident, Chen Yu,

37:35.867 --> 37:37.438
is still in critical condition.

37:37.498 --> 37:38.598
He's still being worked on...

37:38.668 --> 37:39.567
in the ICU.

37:39.637 --> 37:40.808
He's very selfless.

37:40.907 --> 37:41.837
He pushed me and my friend...

37:41.907 --> 37:43.237
out of the bus first.

37:43.407 --> 37:44.277
And the kids too.

37:44.538 --> 37:46.208
If it wasn't because he saved us,

37:46.308 --> 37:47.277
he wouldn't be so badly injured.

37:47.708 --> 37:48.777
That's him in white.

37:48.848 --> 37:49.848
I won't go over there.

37:49.907 --> 37:50.677
Okay, thank you.

37:50.748 --> 37:51.447
You're welcome.

37:53.348 --> 37:54.018
Hello.

37:54.587 --> 37:55.887
You must be Chen Yu's friend.

37:55.987 --> 37:58.288
We're here to find out more about his life.

37:58.558 --> 37:59.418
I'm sorry.

38:00.427 --> 38:01.328
I don't know him well.

38:01.387 --> 38:02.728
We're online friends. We just met.

38:02.887 --> 38:04.657
Can you tell us about your...

38:05.228 --> 38:06.128
I'm sorry.

38:08.898 --> 38:10.438
Forget it. Let's go.

38:11.438 --> 38:12.197
Sir.

38:12.438 --> 38:13.268
Hello.

38:13.608 --> 38:14.907
We'd like to be interviewed.

38:15.208 --> 38:15.867
Sure.

38:16.038 --> 38:17.208
Give us a general background.

38:17.677 --> 38:18.608
Forget it.

38:19.277 --> 38:20.248
He hurt you, me,

38:20.308 --> 38:21.108
and so many people.

38:21.748 --> 38:22.878
It wasn't easy to find him.

38:23.177 --> 38:24.978
I'll take this opportunity to beat him to death.

38:25.918 --> 38:27.817
That piece of trash wants to be a hero?

38:27.887 --> 38:28.587
Dream on.

38:31.987 --> 38:33.058
Are you referring...

38:33.117 --> 38:33.987
to Chen Yu?

38:35.387 --> 38:36.058
Hello, Chief.

38:36.128 --> 38:37.358
I really can't.

38:37.458 --> 38:38.858
Don't interview me.

38:38.927 --> 38:40.567
I get nervous in front of the camera.

38:41.168 --> 38:41.927
Then...

38:42.768 --> 38:43.768
Thanks to the timely rescue,

38:43.837 --> 38:45.768
no one was killed in such a serious accident.

38:45.867 --> 38:47.237
The city leaders are very focused on this.

38:47.367 --> 38:48.867
This is a good opportunity...

38:49.007 --> 38:50.038
to promote yourselves.

38:50.808 --> 38:52.078
We're just doing our jobs.

38:52.137 --> 38:53.507
What's there to promote?

38:54.148 --> 38:56.208
Claim the honor you should claim.

38:56.277 --> 38:57.677
You can't be too low-key.

38:58.947 --> 39:00.348
That will be good for your future.

39:00.447 --> 39:01.288
Ms. Wang.

39:01.547 --> 39:03.018
We're ready.

39:03.148 --> 39:04.558
Okay, we're coming right away.

39:10.927 --> 39:11.927
This is Chief Song Yan...

39:11.998 --> 39:13.967
from Shilitai Fire Station.

39:14.027 --> 39:15.098
He's also the team leader...

39:15.168 --> 39:16.228
of the rescue team this time.

39:16.797 --> 39:17.737
Hello, Chief Song.

39:17.797 --> 39:18.998
Hi, how are you?

39:20.407 --> 39:21.067
Then...

39:21.137 --> 39:22.237
Let's get started.

39:22.608 --> 39:23.268
Hold on.

39:23.878 --> 39:24.608
Come with me.

39:29.108 --> 39:29.777
This way, please.

39:29.848 --> 39:30.518
Hello, Chief.

39:30.918 --> 39:31.578
Hello, Chief.

39:39.288 --> 39:40.018
Dr. Xu.

39:40.087 --> 39:40.788
Present.

39:44.757 --> 39:45.527
Let me introduce you.

39:46.197 --> 39:47.567
This is the team leader...

39:47.628 --> 39:48.668
of our joint rescue team,

39:48.828 --> 39:49.498
Xu Qin.

39:50.168 --> 39:50.898
Regarding the rescue,

39:51.067 --> 39:51.867
the person you should interview...

39:52.067 --> 39:52.998
is her.

39:53.837 --> 39:54.507
Chief Song.

39:55.108 --> 39:57.007
As the commander of this operation,

39:57.337 --> 39:58.308
aren't you going to say anything?

39:59.108 --> 40:00.007
Dr. Xu and the others...

40:00.078 --> 40:01.148
did all the work.

40:01.507 --> 40:02.478
I just helped out.

40:02.547 --> 40:03.348
There's nothing to say.

40:04.748 --> 40:05.918
Hello, Dr. Xu.

40:06.078 --> 40:06.817
I'm a reporter from the News Department...

40:06.878 --> 40:07.887
of the city's TV station.

40:07.987 --> 40:09.087
Regarding the bus rescue,

40:09.148 --> 40:10.757
there are a lot of questions we'd like to ask.

40:10.958 --> 40:11.987
Can we talk now?

40:12.518 --> 40:13.188
Sure.

40:14.587 --> 40:15.358
This way, please.

40:20.058 --> 40:20.728
Song Yan.

40:31.007 --> 40:32.407
Good people who do good things don't leave their names.

40:32.878 --> 40:34.677
You're a living Lei Feng.

40:36.047 --> 40:37.117
Once the news gets out,

40:37.177 --> 40:38.378
no one will look at Dr. Xu...

40:38.447 --> 40:39.418
with prejudice.

40:39.478 --> 40:40.387
No one would think...

40:40.447 --> 40:42.188
that she relies on her family's connections for everything anymore.

40:42.248 --> 40:43.757
Is it right for me to understand that way?

40:45.157 --> 40:46.018
You're right.

40:46.518 --> 40:47.487
Change your name.

40:47.628 --> 40:49.387
You should be called Understanding Jiang.

40:50.257 --> 40:50.927
Okay.

40:51.157 --> 40:52.157
Awkward Song.

41:00.237 --> 41:01.237
How did this happen?

41:02.407 --> 41:03.737
In the incident of the bus that fell off the cliff,

41:03.808 --> 41:05.208
Chen Yu, the civilian hero...

41:05.277 --> 41:06.478
who helped other passengers escape,

41:06.538 --> 41:07.708
turns out to be a con artist.

41:08.078 --> 41:09.478
He conned five victims online...

41:09.547 --> 41:10.878
under the pretense of dating.

41:11.177 --> 41:12.248
One of the victims...

41:12.317 --> 41:13.378
was scammed with up to 500,000 yuan...

41:13.688 --> 41:15.387
for dating him.

41:16.018 --> 41:17.188
He's a scumbag.

41:17.387 --> 41:18.958
He swindles money, sex, and love.

41:19.418 --> 41:21.288
All of us were kept in the dark.

41:21.487 --> 41:22.987
When we first found Ying Ying,

41:23.058 --> 41:24.628
we thought he was cheating on us.

41:24.927 --> 41:26.128
After we got in touch with Ying Ying,

41:26.197 --> 41:28.297
we found out that there were also Xiao Hua,

41:28.367 --> 41:29.998
Man Li, and Yin Lu.

41:30.268 --> 41:31.998
This time, it was Yin Lu who lured him out.

41:32.268 --> 41:33.538
We had a plan.

41:33.598 --> 41:34.538
Once he got out of the bus,

41:34.608 --> 41:36.067
we'll send him straight to the police station.

41:36.407 --> 41:37.538
We didn't expect the bus to flip over...

41:37.608 --> 41:38.938
and he became a hero.

41:39.708 --> 41:40.708
What's going on?

41:40.947 --> 41:42.007
I wonder if it's true.

41:43.777 --> 41:45.677
No wonder when I saw Yin Lu back then,

41:46.148 --> 41:46.918
her facial expression looked weird.

41:47.688 --> 41:48.518
How can a person...

41:48.587 --> 41:50.018
be so noble...

41:50.418 --> 41:51.518
and despicable at the same time?

42:21.288 --> 42:22.087
You're so devoted.

42:23.788 --> 42:25.217
Do you know why I like her?

42:27.188 --> 42:28.328
You like that she's cold.

42:28.728 --> 42:29.387
You...

42:29.587 --> 42:30.728
are a masochist.

42:32.958 --> 42:33.867
She...

42:34.197 --> 42:35.898
is selfish and calculating.

42:36.567 --> 42:38.398
But she never hides her flaws.

42:41.637 --> 42:43.668
If you say she's honest,

42:44.507 --> 42:45.337
that's not right either.

42:48.108 --> 42:49.748
And she seems very noble.

42:55.987 --> 42:57.157
Actually, you two...

42:57.288 --> 42:58.288
care about each other...

42:58.518 --> 42:59.617
